{"id":"663057","name":"泡海参","author":"斌joanliu","authorId":"11138610","desc":"","cover":"images/663057/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"淡干海参","amount":"20条"}],"sub":[{"name":"过滤水","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"海参准备好。","img":"images/663057/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"放入康宁锅中，加过滤清水，放入冰箱冷藏浸泡。","img":"images/663057/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"小时换一次水。","img":"images/663057/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"泡三到四天，摸一下海参软了就可以去内脏了。","img":"images/663057/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"把海参剪开，去掉牙齿等内脏，筋很有营养，不要去。","img":"images/663057/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"一个一个处理好，再清洗干净。","img":"images/663057/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"洗好放入康宁锅中，加清水，煮30分钟，再放冷。","img":"images/663057/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"换清水放冰箱冷藏室再泡2-3天。每天换水。","img":"images/663057/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"满满一锅。","img":"images/663057/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"好大一条。","img":"images/663057/step_10.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：汤锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}